    <briefdescription>
<para>Quantization settings applied during LoRA training. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When <computeroutput>type</computeroutput> is not NONE the base-model weights are quantized before the LoRA adapters are applied. This reduces GPU memory requirements and enables QLoRA-style training on consumer hardware. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
